# Hard value-distribution statements from Hayman

Ten statement-only formalizations selected from W. K. Hayman, *Meromorphic Functions*.

Each problem lives in `Dataset/HaymanMeromorphic/<declaration_name>.lean`,
accompanied by `<declaration_name>.md` (the natural-language statement from
the textbook) and `<declaration_name>.criteria.md` (a quality rubric for
judging formalizations of that statement).
Custom notions shared between problems are in `Dataset/HaymanMeromorphic/Defs.lean`.
-/
